        "content": "<li class='content'><strong>VIRTUAL HORSE RACING</strong></li><li><strong>Win</strong>– bet on the selected horse to win the race (e.g., Horse No.1 finishes 1st).</li><li><strong>Place</strong>(1-2) – bet on the selected horse to finish 1st or 2nd position in a race. (e.g., Selection 1: Horse No.1 finishes 1st or 2nd).</li><li><strong>Show</strong>(1-3) – bet on the selected horse to finish 1st, 2nd or 3rd position in the race (e.g., Selection 1: Horse No.1 finishes 1st, 2nd or 3rd).</li><li><strong>Even/Odd</strong>– bet on horse No. Even (2/4/6) or horse No.Odd (1/3/5) as winner.</li><li><strong>Over/Under</strong>– bet on the winner horse is over or under No.3.5 (Selection Over: Horse No.4/No.5/No.6 finishes 1st; Selection Under: Horse No.1/No.2/No.3 finishes 1st).</li><li><strong>Exacta</strong>– bet on the 2 horses finishing in 1st and 2nd positions, in the order predicted. Both predictions must be correct for the bet to win. (e.g., Selection 1, 2: Horse No.1 finishes 1st, Horse No.2 finishes 2nd).</li><li><strong>Quinella</strong>– bet on the 2 horses you expect to finish 1st and 2nd in any order. Both predictions must be correct for the bets to win. (e.g., Selection1&amp;2: Horses No.1 and No.2 finish 1st and 2nd in any order).</li><li><strong>Trifecta</strong>– bet on the 3 horses you expect to finish 1st, 2nd and 3rd in the correct order. All three predictions must be correct for the bet to win. (e.g., Selection 1, 2, 3: Horse No.1 finishes 1st, Horse No.2 finishes 2nd, Horse No.3 finishes 3rd).</li>"
      },
