        "title": "Definitions and Interpretation",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>The terms used in this Privacy Policy have the same meaning as in our <a href=\"http://www.betika.com\">Terms and Conditions</a>. However, for the purposes of this Privacy Policy and the Introduction above, unless the context otherwise requires: </p><ol><li>\"<strong>Applicable Laws</strong>\" means the Data Protection Laws and any relevant international data protection laws; </li><li>\"<strong>Betika Service(s)</strong>\" has the meaning given to it in the <a href=\"http://www.betika.com\">Terms and Conditions</a> and \"Services\" shall be construed accordingly; </li><li>\"<strong>Channel(s)</strong>\" means the Betika website, mobile app, social media platforms and any other platforms used to offer the Betika Services; </li><li>\"<strong>Customer(s)</strong>\" means registered users of the Betika Service;</li><li>\"<strong>Data Protection Laws</strong>\" means the Data Protection Act, 2019, as amended and \"Local Data Protection Laws\" shall be construed accordingly;</li><li>\"<strong>Personal Data</strong>\" means any information about an identified or identifiable natural person and \"Personal Data\" shall be construed accordingly; </li></ol><p> </p><ol><li>\"<strong>Sensitive Personal Data</strong>\" has the meaning given to it in the Data Protection Act, 2019; </li></ol><p>Interpretation </p><ol><li>In addition to the above definitions, unless the context requires otherwise: the singular shall include the plural and vice versa;</li><li>A reference to any one gender, whether masculine or feminine includes the other two; </li><li>A reference to \"We\" \"Us\" \"Our\" is a reference to Shop and Deliver Limited, Betika and or its successors in title and assigns. </li>"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.3",
        "title": "How Your Personal Data is Collected",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>We collect your Personal Data when you interact with us or use our Services in any of the following ways <a id=\"_Hlk88488471\"></a>(this list is subject to amendment from time to time as per clause 19 below):</p><ol><li>Visit, access or use any of the Betika Services, events, business premises and / or Channels;</li><li>Subscribe or register to our Services and products, including but not limited to: betting and gaming services offered at <a href=\"http://www.betika.com\">www.betika.com</a>, promotional offers, tournaments, and competitions;</li><li>Participate in any of Betika’s platforms, for example discussion boards on our website or social media platforms, promotions or surveys, report a problem with our mobile app, website, Services or products, or ask for more information on a Service or product;</li><li>Interact with us as a supplier, agent, merchant, or dealer of Betika Services; and</li><li>From third party sources, where:<ol><li>your Personal Data is contained in a public record; </li><li>where you have deliberately made your Personal Data public; </li><li>where you have given us consent to collect your Personal Data from a third party;</li><li>where you have an incapacity, and the guardian appointed has given us consent to collect your Personal Data from a third party; </li><li>where our collection from a third party would not prejudice your interests; and </li><li>where our collection of your Personal Data from a third party is necessary:<ul><li> to prevent, detect, investigate, prosecute, and punish a crime; </li><li>to enforce a law that imposes a pecuniary penalty; or </li><li>to protect your interests or the interests of another person.</li></ul></li></ol></li>"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.5",
        "title": "The Personal Data We Collect about You",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n<p>We may collect, use, and store different kinds of Personal Data about you, which we have grouped together as follows: </p><ol><li><strong>Identity Information </strong>- includes name, ID number, age, mobile number, address, date of birth, email address, gender, CCTV images when you visit our premises; </li><li><strong>Technical Information</strong> - includes the type of mobile device you use, unique device identifiers such as internet protocol (IP) address of your computer or smart phone, your login information, browser type and version, time zone setting and location, browser plug-in types and versions, operating system and platform, mobile network information and other technology on the devices you use to access our Channels;</li><li><strong>Financial Information</strong> - includes your transaction information when you withdraw from or deposit into your Betika account, information we obtain from fraud prevention agencies, Anti-Money Laundering agencies and any government regulator;</li><li><a id=\"(b)_content_information,_including_infor\"></a><strong>Contact Information</strong> - includes information stored on your device, including contact lists, call logs, SMS logs, social media friends, followers, and contacts, contact lists from other social media accounts, photos, videos, or other digital content;</li><li><a id=\"(c)_data_from_your_use_of_any_other_thir\"></a><a id=\"(d)_log_information_including,_details_o\"></a><strong>Log Information</strong> - includes details of your use of any of our Channels; including, but not limited to, traffic data, location data, weblogs, and other communication data;</li></ol><p><a id=\"(e)_your_name,_address,_e-mail_address_a\"></a></p><ol><li><a id=\"(f)_information_about_your_visit,_includ\"></a><strong>Visit Information</strong> – includes information about your visit, including the full Uniform Resource Locators (URL) clickstream to, through and from our App, system, and network (including date and time); Services or products you viewed or searched for or requested; page response times, download errors, length of visits to certain pages, page interaction information and any phone number used to request a Service or call our customer service number;</li><li><a id=\"(g)_location_information_using_GPS_techn\"></a><strong>Location Information </strong>- using GPS technology or other location finding services to determine your current location;</li><li><strong>Profile Information </strong>-  includes your social media profiles, your username and password, your interests, feedback personal preferences collected in surveys and recordings.</li>\n"
