design and plan Customer interactions with our Services and campaigns. To ensure constant and smooth engagement with Customers </p></td><td><ul><li>Identity </li><li>Contact </li><li>Profile </li><li>Technical</li><li>Visit</li><li>Log</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><p>To ensure smooth business operations for the Services and the and mobile and App platforms and end to end user experience</p></td><td><ul><li>Technical </li><li>Log </li><li>Visit </li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><p>To create awareness and promote the company and it's products and increase customer base</p></td><td><ul><li>Identity </li><li>Contact</li><li>Technical</li><li>Log</li><li>Profile </li><li>Visit</li><li>Location</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><p>To Process payments of invoices and reconciliation of accounts</p></td><td><ul><li>Financial Information</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><p>To effectively administer and manage last expense benefits payments</p></td><td><ul><li>Next of Kin</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><p>For regulatory compliance and to complete  background checks (KYC) on Customers during Customer lifecycle management in the off-boarding of a Customer</p></td><td><ul><li>Preferences</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td></tr></table> \n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.7",
        "title": "Lawful Basis for processing your information",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n<p>  In compliance with the relevant local and international data protection laws,  we will only process your information in accordance with any of the lawful  basis provided for under these laws which include:</p><ol>  <li>The<strong> </strong>performance of an agreement with you;</li>  <li>Betika’s legitimate business interests;</li>  <li>Compliance with any mandatory legal obligations;</li>  <li>Your consent;</li>  <li>Your vital interest; and</li>  <li>Public interest.</li></ol>\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.8",
        "title": " Special Categories of Personal Data",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>Through your interaction with any of the Betika Services, premises, or our Channels, we may collect Sensitive Personal Data about you to the extent that the same is necessary for the full and proper operation of the Betika Services that we offer to you </p><p>Should we wish to process your Sensitive Personal Data, we shall seek your specific consent first and ensure that the processing is necessary for:</p><ol><li>: <ol><li>the establishment, exercise or defence of a legal claim; </li><li>the purposes of carrying out our or your obligations and exercising our or your  specific rights; or </li><li>protecting your vital interests or the vital interests of another person if you are legally incapable of giving consent. </li></ol></li> \n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.9",
        "title": "Retention of Information",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>We shall only retain your Personal Data for as long as reasonably necessary to fulfil the purposes we collected it for, unless our retention is: </p><ol><li>required or authorized by law or reasonably necessary for a lawful purpose, for instance for the purposes of satisfying any legal, regulatory, tax, accounting or reporting requirements; </li><li>Authorized or consented by you for any reason, including for the purposes of carrying out any obligation to you under an agreement with Betika; or</li><li>For historical, statistical, journalistic literature and art or research purposes. </li></ol><p>We may retain your Personal Data for a longer period in the event of a complaint or if we reasonably believe there is a prospect of litigation in respect of our relationship with you.</p><p>To determine the appropriate retention period for personal data, we shall consider:</p><ol><li>the amount, nature, and sensitivity of the Personal Data;</li><li>the potential risk of harm from unauthorized use or disclosure of your Personal Data;</li><li>the purposes for which we process your Personal Data and whether we can achieve those purposes through other means; and</li><li>the need to comply with our internal policy and the applicable legal, regulatory, tax, accounting or other requirements.</li></ol><p>We shall delete, erase, anonymize or pseudonymize your Personal Data that is not necessary to be retained at the expiry of the retention period. </p> \n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.10",
        "title": "Disclosure of Information",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>Any disclosure of your Personal Data shall be in accordance with applicable law and regulations. </p><p>We may disclose your Personal Data to: </p><ol><li>law-enforcement agencies, regulatory authorities, courts, or other statutory authorities in response to a demand issued with the appropriate lawful mandate and where the form and scope of the demand is compliant with the law;</li><li>our subsidiaries, associates, partners, merchants, or agents who are involved in delivering Betika products and Services you subscribe to or use;</li><li>third parties to whom we may choose to sell, transfer or merge parts of our business or our assets or to whom we may seek to acquire our businesses or merge with; </li><li>fraud prevention and  anti-money laundering agencies;</li><li>publicly available and/or restricted government databases to verify your identity information in order to comply with regulatory requirements;</li><li>survey agencies that conduct surveys on behalf of Betika; and</li><li>any other person that we are lawfully permitted to share the data with.</li> \n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.11",
        "title": "Commercial Use of Data and Direct Marketing",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>We shall obtain your express consent prior to using your Personal Data for commercial purposes, unless we are authorized under any written law to use your Personal Data for commercial purposes, and we have informed you of such authorization when collecting the data from you. </p><p>We shall where possible, anonymize any Personal Data that we use for commercial purposes in such a manner as to ensure that you are no longer identifiable. </p><p>We shall obtain your express consent prior to disclosing your Personal Data with any third party for direct marketing purposes. In particular:</p><ol><li>you may be required to opt-in or give any other form of explicit consent before receiving marketing messages from us;</li><li>you have the right to request us to stop sending you marketing messages at any time by:<ol><li> writing to us or contacting us through our contacts provided in clause 20; </li><li>checking or unchecking relevant boxes to adjust your marketing preferences; or </li><li>following the opt-out links on any marketing message sent to you.</li></ol></li> \n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.12",
        "title": "Cookies",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>Cookies are files with small amount of data that are commonly used as an anonymous unique identifier. These are sent to your browser from our Channels that you visit and are stored on your phone/computer. Subject to your consent, we shall use cookies for the following purposes:</p><ol><li>to identify your preferred language so that it can be automatically selected when you return to our Channels;</li><li>to ensure that the bets you place are associated with your bet slip and account;</li><li>to ensure that you receive any bonuses that you are eligible for; and</li><li>to analyse our Channels’ traffic in order to make suitable improvements.</li></ol><p>You have the option to either accept or refuse these cookies, as you shall be informed of when you access our website through  your phone/computer. Please note that if you choose to refuse our cookies, you may not be able to access some of the features on our Channels. </p> \n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.13",
        "title": "Access to and Updating your Information",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>To update your information, please contact us by sending an email to the email address provided in clause 20. </p><ol><li><a id=\"_Ref87960716\"></a> \n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.14",
        "title": "Safeguarding and Protection of Information",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>Betika has put in place appropriate technical, operational and security measures to protect and prevent your Personal Data from unauthorized access, accidental loss, destruction or alteration. In addition, we limit access to your Personal Data to those employees, agents, contractors and third parties who have a business need to know this information. They shall only process your Personal Data on our instructions and shall be subject to a duty of strict confidentiality. </p><p>We have further put in place procedures to deal with any suspected and material Personal Data breaches and shall notify you and any applicable regulator of such a breach where we are legally required to do so. </p><p>For more information on our safeguarding and security measures, please contact us with the information provided in clause 20.</p>\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.15",
        "title": "International Data Transfers",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>From time to time we may need to transfer your Personal Data outside of Kenya and outside of the country where you are registered as a Customer.</p><p>We shall only transfer your Personal Data outside of Kenya where we have your consent to do so or have a lawful basis for carrying out such a transfer.</p><p>We shall only transfer your Sensitive Personal Data outside of Kenya upon obtaining your consent and obtaining confirmation of appropriate safeguards. </p><p>We shall only transfer your Personal Data outside of the scope of the jurisdiction of the Applicable Laws and Data Protection Laws if you are registered as a Customer within those jurisdictions, in accordance with such Applicable Laws. </p> \n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.16",
        "title": "Your Rights",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>Subject to legal and contractual exceptions, you have rights under Data Protection Laws in relation to your Personal Data. These are listed below:</p><ol><li>right to be informed that we are collecting Personal Data about you;</li><li>right to be informed of the use to which your Personal Data is to be put; </li><li>right to access the Personal Data that we hold about you and request information about how we process it;</li><li>right to the correction of your Personal Data where it is false, misleading, inaccurate, or incomplete;</li><li>right to the erasure of your Personal Data if it is false or misleading;</li><li>Right to object and withdraw your consent to the processing of your Personal Data, we may continue to process if we have a legitimate or legal reason to do so;</li><li>right to request restricted processing of your Personal Data noting that unless the data is being stored, we will only process such data with your consent or as legally obligated by any Applicable Laws or as required by a court or government authority to protect the rights of another person. We will inform you before withdrawing the restriction on processing of the personal data.; and</li><li>right to data portability that is the  right to receive Personal Data concerning you in a structured, commonly used and machine-readable format and to have such data shared with another data controller or processor in an efficient and easy manner. </li></ol><p>If you wish to exercise any of the rights set out above, please contact us <a id=\"_Hlk87973289\"></a>as per the information provided in clause 20. </p><p>We may need to request specific information from you to help us confirm your identity and ensure your right to access your Personal Data (or to exercise any of your other rights). This is a security measure to ensure that Personal Data is not disclosed to any person who has no right to receive it. We may also contact you to ask you for further information in relation to your request to speed up our response.</p><p>We endeavour to respond to all legitimate requests within reasonable time. Occasionally it could take us longer if your request is particularly complex or you have made a number of requests. In this case, we will notify you and keep you updated on the estimated response time.</p> \n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.17",
        "title": "Help Contribute to the Protection of your Personal Data",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>You can help maintain the security of your Personal Data by undertaking the following helpful tips:<strong> </strong></p><ol><li>do not share your phone number, ID number, account password or betting patterns (such as amounts and time) with anyone;</li><li>change your account password on a regular basis;</li><li>remember to sign off after visiting our Channels;</li><li>inform Betika of any changes that occur in your Personal Data to facilitate maintenance of accurate and up-to-date records; </li><li>do not send any of your Personal Data via non-encrypted e-mail; and</li><li>do not supply your Personal Data to any website that you do not know or trust.</li> \n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.18",
        "title": "Right to Lodge Complaint",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n<p>You have the right to lodge a complaint with the Kenyan Data Commissioner or equivalent supervisory authority in accordance with the Applicable Laws, that operate within the country of operation where you are registered as a customer.</p>\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.19",
        "title": "Non-Compliance with this Privacy Policy",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>Betika reserves the right to terminate any agreement with you for failure to comply with the provisions of this Privacy Policy and its <a href=\"http://www.betika.com\">Terms and Conditions</a> and reject any application for information contrary to this Privacy Policy. </p><ol><li><a id=\"_Ref87954165\"></a><a id=\"_Ref88488522\"></a> \n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.20",
        "title": "Amendments to this Privacy Policy",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>Betika reserves the right to amend any part of this Privacy Policy, to the extent permissible by law. Where such an amendment is made, We shall notify you via our Channels and you should check our Channels frequently to stay up to date with any recent changes. Unless stated otherwise, our current Privacy Policy applies to all Personal Data that we have about you and your account. </p><ol><li><a id=\"_Ref87971754\"></a> \n"
      },
      {
        "id": "4.21",
        "title": "Our contacts",
        "miniCategories": [],
        "content": "\n <p>Should you have any further queries or questions about the processing of your Personal Data, our full contact details are as follows: </p><p><strong>Name</strong>: Shop and Deliver Limited </p><p><strong>Email address</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:dpo@betika.com\">dpo@betika.com</a> </p><p><strong>Postal address</strong>: P.O. Box 1145-00600, Nairobi, Kenya</p><p><strong>Telephone number</strong>: 0729-290-290</p><p><strong>Contact person</strong>: The Data Protection Officer</p> \n"
