rior notice.</li><li>In the event of the occurrence or suspected occurrence of any Prohibited Activities, including underage gambling, fraud, collusion, match-fixing, use of inside information, money laundering, or any conduct that jeopardises the integrity of the event, we may take whatever action we consider necessary, including voiding bets, withholding winnings, suspending accounts, blocking IP addresses, and informing relevant authorities.</li><li>Where a dispute arises concerning the Must Be Won Jackpot, the adjudication and decision of the Gambling Regulatory Authority (GRA) of Kenya shall be final.</li><li>The Must Be Won Jackpot is provided “as is” without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied, including warranties relating to accuracy, availability, timing, non-interference, merchantability, or fitness for a particular purpose, except where such warranties are required by law and cannot be excluded.</li><li>These Terms are governed by our General Terms and Conditions. Unless otherwise defined in these Terms, words used here have the same meaning as in our General Terms and Conditions. Where there is any inconsistency between these Terms and the General Terms and Conditions, the General Terms and Conditions shall prevail.</li></ol></div>"
